{
  "job_B3.2.24_20251003_114627": {
    "chunk_text": "h\u00e6lendes \u00feegn Nicodemus w\u00e6s haten. Brohte \u00fe\u00e6r sume smyrenesse swi\u00f0e swete of myrran & of o\u00f0rum deorwyr\u00feum wyrtum, & geworhte \u00dea genamon hie Cristes h\u00e6lendes lichoman & hine adune adydon, & hine ealne gesmyredon mid \u00feam \u00dea h\u00e6fde Ioseph se goda man him sylfum niwe byrgene geworhte, in anum swi\u00f0e myclum stane \u00dea genamon hie for \u00feam ofeste, & gesetton \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes lichoman in \u00fea byrgenne. Men \u00fea leofestan, hw\u00e6t, ure drihten \u00e6lmihtig God, \u00fea his haliga lichama in \u00fea halgan byrgenne Ac utan we nu for \u00fean a singalice ussum dryhtne h\u00e6lendan Criste \u00feanc secgan eallre \u00fe\u00e6re Utan we hine nu lufigan ofer eall o\u00f0re \u00feing, swa we nu gehyra\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he us lufode & us hyldo to.",
